      "id": "claim_f797db2a25ab4709beca6aff9f520299",
      "statement": "The apiClient singleton auto-injects Authorization: Bearer token and X-Cabinet-Id headers from useAuthStore on every request unless skipped via options; an immutable per-request authToken/cabinetIdOverride wins over the mutable store values (Story 167.9) so a request authenticates as the session that initiated it, and on a 401 the interceptor performs single-flight reactive refresh with exactly one replay (D-2).",
