    {
      "id": "claim_c2b498419d0c456ab4397586d1309d8b",
      "statement": "createCabinet (and symmetrically getCabinetCreationOperation) opts out of reactive refresh via allowReactiveRefresh: false — a 401 on the durable, Idempotency-Key-scoped account-scoped create is the pinned initiating session's credential failure whose retry is owned by Story 167.8 reconciliation; replaying under a rotated different session's token would mask the failure and drop the Idempotency-Key↔session pairing.",
