    {
      "id": "claim_30dc56c0934741a89d3a69f3447af10e",
      "statement": "There is no dedicated tasks API module: /v1/tasks/enqueue call sites (useSanityCheck, useManualMarginRecalculation, useMoyskladSync) build the body inline and post through the shared apiClient; the tasks-enqueue-role-contract test pins that a Manager gets 200 with auto-injected headers while an Analyst's RolesGuard 403 surfaces as a real ApiError with exactly one request — apiClient never auto-retries permission denials.",
